'Lower 60sec status flag';

comment on column PREDISPATCHLOAD.LOWER5MINFLAGS is
'Lower 5min status flag';

comment on column PREDISPATCHLOAD.LOWERREGFLAGS is
'Lower Reg status flag';

comment on column PREDISPATCHLOAD.RAISE6SECACTUALAVAILABILITY is
'trapezium adjusted raise 6sec availability';

comment on column PREDISPATCHLOAD.RAISE60SECACTUALAVAILABILITY is
'trapezium adjusted raise 60sec availability';

comment on column PREDISPATCHLOAD.RAISE5MINACTUALAVAILABILITY is
'trapezium adjusted raise 5min availability';

