comment on table RESDEMANDTRK is
'RESDEMANDTRK defines the existence and versioning information of a forecast for a specific region and trading date.
RESDEMANDTRK and PERDEMAND have a parent/child relationship, and are for defined forecast regional demands since market start. RESDEMANDTRK defines the existence and versioning information of a forecast for a specific region and trading date. PERDEMAND defines the numerical forecast values for each trading interval of a the trading day for that region. A complete trading day forecast for one region consists of one RESDEMANDTRK record and 48 PERDEMAND records.';

