comment on table TRADINGPRICE is
'TRADINGPRICE sets out 5 minutes spot market price, including fields to handle the Ancillary Services functionality. If prices are adjusted, the final price is recorded in the regional reference price (RRP) field with price before adjustment recorded in the regional original price (ROP) field.
Prior to 5 Minute Settlements, this was half-hourly spot market values, which was calculated as the average of the six 5 minute dispatch intervals within the 30 minute period.';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.SETTLEMENTDATE is
'Date that this data applies to';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RUNNO is
'Run No';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.REGIONID is
'Region Identifier';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.PERIODID is
'Period number where 1 represents the trading interval ending at 00:05 AEST';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RRP is
'Regional reference price for this dispatch period';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.EEP is
'Excess energy price where negative average';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.INVALIDFLAG is
'Indicates when the Trading interval price has been adjusted after the trading interval was completed';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.LASTCHANGED is
'Last date and time record changed';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.ROP is
'Regional Original Price. The price before any adjustments were made';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE6SECRRP is
'Regional reference price for this dispatch period';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE6SECROP is
'Original regional price - prior to APC or VoLL overrides applied';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE60SECRRP is
'Regional reference price for this dispatch period';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE60SECROP is
'Original regional price - prior to APC or VoLL overrides applied';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE5MINRRP is
'Regional reference price for this dispatch period';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISE5MINROP is
'Original regional price - prior to APC or VoLL overrides applied';

comment on column TRADINGPRICE.RAISEREGRRP is
'Regional reference price for this dispatch period';

